        "toolDescription": "Prepare a persistent proposal to email the user registered address. Does not send mail. The real user must subsequently confirm using the returned instruction. Never choose recipient, supply email text, or claim Gmail delivery. Allowed SUBSCRIPTION_INFO only.",
